      "description": "PROPOSED (PSC 0.2.5, pending the product owner's review). Private governance-only write recording an operator's withdrawal of one originally accepted invocation that was provably never dispatched. Sent only after the operator confirms it; refused with already_dispatched once any execution is recorded. No reason text, execution facts or replacement inputs. Not an MCP tool."
