      "kind": "UpdateBoardProgram",
      "write": true,
      "required": [["mode","s"],["expectedProgramGeneration","n"],["reason","s"]],
      "manifest": [],
      "sample": {"kind":"UpdateBoardProgram","mode":"cancel","expectedProgramGeneration":0,"reason":"operator cancelled the pending update"},
      "note": "Private governance control for the one pending program; never a model tool. Submit takes one complete program.packs snapshot and replaces any pending proposal. Migration includes every live root and cancellation does not change execution fences."
    },
    {
      "kind":"SetLawLock","write":true,
      "required":[["locked","b"],["reason","s"]],"manifest":[],
      "sample":{"kind":"SetLawLock","locked":true,"reason":"lock the installed rules"},
      "note":"Immediate private legislation control, independent of pending program activation. Current law permits narrowing by any authorized principal and requires governance to unlock; Workers cannot call it. Not a model tool."
    },
    {
      "kind":"SetExplorationMode","write":true,
      "required":[["connectionId","s"],["mode","s"],["reason","s"]],"manifest":[],
      "sample":{"kind":"SetExplorationMode","connectionId":"connection-1","mode":"non_strict","reason":"owner set non-strict exploration mode"},
      "note":"PROPOSED (PSC 0.2.5, S28, D-1005h and D-1005i; the text awaits the owner's review). Private immediate control write for one Connection's exploration mode, independent of pending program activation like SetLawLock. mode is strict or non_strict. non_strict writes the host-owned reserved fact exploration_mode, strict removes it, and the absence of the fact is strict. It needs an authenticated operator governance role and Board write permission and is refused outright when the request carries a Connection or Worker identity or an empty reason. It only changes the value-grounding check of workspace direct Worker Actions (board-spec TOOL-08b); it grants no execution right. In no manifest tag and in no MCP tool list: whether inputs must be grounded is an owner decision, not a model one."
    },
    {
      "kind":"SetSignOffRequired","write":true,"historical":true,
      "required":[["required","b"],["reason","s"]],"manifest":[],
      "sample":{"kind":"SetSignOffRequired","required":true,"reason":"owner requires a second seat to sign completed Cases"},
      "note":"Retired by D-1013a. Historical decoding only: stored commands, original results and sign-off records remain readable without deletion or rewriting; no new control writes, no manifest tag and no MCP tool."
    },
    {
      "kind":"EndGoal","write":true,
